{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《女神配對計劃 2》最新一集移師主題公園大玩水上遊戲，七位女神何沛珈（Roxanne）、陳若思（Amber）、郭珮文（Juliana）、阮嘉敏（Mandy）、俞可程（Kanis）、梁超怡（Chiuyi）及陳星妤（Yvette）上演「出水芙蓉」Look，場面香艷！但在瀡滑梯環節，眾女神真性情大爆發，Mandy竟因童年陰影嚇到爆喊，Yvette更全程「奪命狂呼」，究竟她們的真實反應會否影響求愛勇者的選擇？\n</p>\n<h2>Mandy阮嘉敏自揭童年陰影 瀡滑梯嚇到喊</h2>\n<p>在瀡滑梯挑戰中，一眾女神的真實性格表露無遺。當中以阮嘉敏（Mandy）及何沛珈（Roxanne）反應最為膽小，兩人均嚇到落淚。Mandy更親自揭開內心創傷，原來她對水有極大陰影，她憶述：「我細個喺泳池浸親過，鼻吸晒水，個人又飲咗好多水，好辛苦。」童年陰影令她在遊戲中難掩恐懼，與平時開朗的形象形成極大反差。相比之下，郭珮文（阿Ju）則表現得相當平靜，屬於大膽型，淡定完成挑戰。</p>\n<h2>Yvette陳星妤高空奪命狂呼 Amber陳若思表情管理成王者</h2>\n<p>除了爆喊的Mandy，陳星妤（Yvette）和梁超怡（超怡）則屬於「喊驚型」。Yvette從滑梯高處開始，便一路「奪命狂呼」直到落水，誇張的尖叫聲震撼了現場所有人士，場面非常搞笑。而另一邊的陳若思（Amber）則貫徹其「就算驚都要靚住驚」的宗旨，在整個過程中依然保持極佳的表情管理，落水一刻更被指猶如在拍攝廣告般省鏡，成為全場唯一的「表情王者」，展現出截然不同的女神面貌。</p>\n<h2>女神排名定生死 包尾兩位揀男伴輸蝕</h2>\n<p>今次的挑戰並非純粹玩樂，賽果更直接影響之後的配對。根據規則，七位女神將按照上一回合所得的名次，由第一名開始順序瀡落滑梯，並挑選下一輪一同作戰的求愛勇者。除了排第六及第七名的女神，每位女神都可以挑選兩名男伴。這意味著排名包尾的兩位女神在選擇權上相對輸蝕，隨時可能錯失與心儀對象組隊的機會，令這個看似簡單的環節增添了幾分緊張感。</p>\n<h2>網民心痛Mandy力撐女神真性情</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，網民對女神們的真實反應展開熱烈討論，不少人對Mandy的經歷表示心痛。有網民留言力撐：「Mandy好慘，童年陰影真係好難克服，睇到都心痛！」、「呢啲先係真人騷，見到佢哋最真實一面！」亦有網民大讚其他女神：「Amber真係世界級，驚都可以咁靚！」、「Yvette個尖叫聲穿過個mon都聽到，好好笑！」、「阿Ju原來咁大膽，反差好正！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_11566712366ae42c573878d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_11566712366ae42c573878d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_9262571526ae42c5a48fe2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_9262571526ae42c5a48fe2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_3333475056ae42c6bd4190.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_3333475056ae42c6bd4190.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20_10291605876ae42c77f1064.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20_10291605876ae42c77f1064.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/22_18580523066ae42c7f9ddff.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/22_18580523066ae42c7f9ddff.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26_7135997976ae42c8e68098.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26_7135997976ae42c8e68098.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/30_10408657086ae42c9e15007.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/30_10408657086ae42c9e15007.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/31_19619101896ae42ca0dda61.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/31_19619101896ae42ca0dda61.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/32_15792548276ae42ca411d93.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/32_15792548276ae42ca411d93.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/33_8088300536ae42ca7ea55d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/33_8088300536ae42ca7ea55d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/34_20442270966ae42caae7457.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/34_20442270966ae42caae7457.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/39_16189006006ae42cba522c4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/39_16189006006ae42cba522c4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/40_10428648436ae42cbe50489.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/40_10428648436ae42cbe50489.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/44_12563427616ae42cc88d082.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/44_12563427616ae42cc88d082.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:23:46.791547+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1376,"images":14,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:00:45+00:00","fetched_a